 class="chapter-number"&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 4: ATAC-seq analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/Lab5.html"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;14&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 5: Comparing sets of ChIP-seq peaks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/Lab6.html"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 6: Motif enrichment analysis from ChIP-seq data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/Lab7.html"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 7: Hi-C data processing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/Lab8.html"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;17&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 8: Investigating Hi-C contact maps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/Lab9.html"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Lab 9: Multi-omics data integration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:quarto-sidebar-section-3"&gt;Appendices&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-int-sidebar:/pages/extra.html"&gt;Extra resources&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="footer-left"&gt;This book was built with &lt;a href="https://github.com/js2264/BiocBook/"&gt;BiocBook&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;span class="emoji" data-emoji="heart"&gt;❤️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-breadcrumbs-895beed11a772a15c254d2d597183327"&gt;Lecture slides&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-breadcrumbs-1d34505ab0dcea42373a4efe494a780d"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;General processing of NGS data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
