s="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-breadcrumbs-8548c45a3c0ec89b5b7197f3d3eafa8a"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Quantification of gene expression&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
