ass="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-breadcrumbs-426a607d6ab5b9088dfa3d272924fe43"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Introduction to ChIP-seq processing and analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
