lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden" data-render-id="quarto-breadcrumbs-3bfe044ebb13bd556708a4f6af069fad"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Identifying structural features from Hi-C data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
